_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRlP4uvbNRxHTsVcN3WWKLoMZ3FugfBn4tE5ApxhwhhHw&oe=6AF46EDE"}, {"file_name": "2SCREEN34.png", "id": "1388436212622754", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_1388436215956087_6312047013829292704_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hf1robA9Z_IQ7kNvwHbH7PS&_nc_oc=AdpOaay60_EajT2vMDbUzsQyf4CXAQPLnNy8lekIJu1dcCbAyTM4A0QiwZbw0VaHk0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQROIJbf5IItwARY_u4uO9LaQdUcevAzd3xit5-17T6wxQ&oe=6AF49206"}, {"file_name": "2SCREEN345.png", "id": "1054920744061435", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314351_1054920747394768_7998152015695449678_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X3TYLWopjRQQ7kNvwFUHaxU&_nc_oc=Adqa_cEdH47KmcSjiZ8PUPZ24wIX_AJbltsHhXrHWd9jCPlJlHsU_arMThoMkEM-n20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSoodWjQHg93EjrEw7GMxHWqKFT-c49bpoFSvKjlYMig&oe=6AF49D29"}, {"file_name": "2SCREEN.png", "id": "956364097480853", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_956364100814186_3737536527307266226_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ebZ8KG3N6uMQ7kNvwHrLpYA&_nc_oc=Adp5-rSaNGUNvwNPPaWyP2VRJm9pzzka0jxIxKHHPLfO_KWDOfsuCOS1wcQgTap9fiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT9JEJqYwk9t6DGU2Pn4ZgMJHTi2w3qimC5MnGxegURkg&oe=6AF47532"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Big Big Walk VR", "keywords": ["big", "walk", "survival", "adventure", "climb"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf0d Big Big Walk VR\n\nWelcome to Big Big Walk VR! Step into a huge open world and experience the simple joy of exploring in Big Big Walk VR! Put on your headset, start walking, keep jumping, and see just how far your adventure can take you. There are no complicated mechanics - just you, and your big walk... it's time to take a step and a big walk!\n\nWhether you're looking for a relaxing VR experience or simply want to enjoy the feeling of movement in a giant environment, Big Big Walk VR lets you wander at your own pace. Walk across endless fields, climb steep hills, jump over obstacles, and discover scenic viewpoints as you immerse yourself in virtual reality.\n\n\ud83d\udeb6 Explore a Massive World\n\nEvery direction offers somewhere new to go. From wide open landscapes to hidden locations waiting to be found, there's always another place to explore.\n\n\ud83e\udd98 Jump, Climb & Keep Moving\n\nMaster your movement by jumping across gaps, climbing natural terrain, and reaching places that reward curious explorers.\n\n\ud83e\udd7d Built for Virtual Reality\n\nExperience smooth and immersive VR gameplay designed to make exploration feel natural and enjoyable. Every step brings you deeper into the world.\n\n\ud83c\udf04 Relax and Explore\n\nTake your time, enjoy the scenery, and experience a peaceful world where exploration is the main objective. Perfect for players who enjoy relaxing VR adventures.\n\n\u2728 Features\n\ud83d\udeb6 Freedom to walk wherever you want\n\ud83e\udd98 Fun jumping and traversal mechanics\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Hills, valleys to climb", "short_description": "Big Big Walk VR is a relaxing VR adventure where the journey is the destination. Explore a massive open landscape, climb hills, leap across obstacles, and discover hidden places as you walk, jump, and take in the world around you. Are you ready for your Big Walk?\n\nWhether you want to peacefully explore at your own pace or challenge yourself to reach every corner of the map, Big Big Walk VR is all about movement, freedom, and the joy of exploring a giant world in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://MBGameStudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort